<title>USA: Cross Timbers stake raised by Ronald Baron.</title>
<headline>Cross Timbers stake raised by Ronald Baron.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group controled by New York investor Ronald Baron said Monday it has increased his stake in Cross Timbers Oil Co. to 11.5 percent or 3,172,450 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the investor said his group most recently acquired 300,100 shares of the Fort Worth, Texas oil and gas company between April 16 and June 16 at $15.53 to $19.78 each.</p>
